### ALL CARS
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cars

### CREATE CAR
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cars
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brand": "Marca",
  "model": "Modelo",
  "year": 2018,
  "plate": "BBC-1D00"
}

> {% client.global.set("carId", response.body.id); %}

### CREATE ITENS
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cars/{{carId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

  [
    "Ar condicionado",
    "Trava Eletrica",
    "Trava Eletrica",
    "Trava Eletrica",
    "Trava Eletrica",
    "Vidro Eletrico"
  ]
